.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH SUM 1 "2026-09-01"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sum \- Checksum and count the blocks in a file.

With no FILE, or when FILE is \-, read standard input.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsum\fR [OPTION]... [FILE]...
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Checksum and count the blocks in a file.
.PP
With no FILE, or when FILE is \-, read standard input.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-r\fR
use the BSD sum algorithm, use 1K blocks (default)
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-sysv\fR
use System V sum algorithm, use 512 bytes blocks
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v(uutils coreutils) 0.11.0
